 "must": [
  "om_book_after",
  "om_book_before",
  "fcf_book_after"
 ],
 "note": "is the residual a book worth owning: the weight-weighted operating margin and FCF margin of the residual book (t2's scenario weights) against the original, renormalised over the names each measure covers; ROE across the survivors ranked; and the weight x 63d-vol sum before/after as the risk side. Coverage refusals inside the vectors are genuine: JPM (bank), LLY/XOM (no operating_income line), TLT/HYG (no issuer accounts) — so the margin figures describe the five tech names, and the answer says the residual's quality judgement rests on a partial view."
}
